      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "° Creates a symbolic link :\n    - the symbolic name is /mnt/models\n    - the target directory ( the real directory ) is /models\n    - Remember that the Image is built using /models as the directory that contains the Model\nthen\n° Sleeps\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
